tasiosa","rating":"l"},"esrb":{"rating":"e"},"igrs":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Kekerasan","rating":"13","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"13","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"17 Apr, 2020"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cRainbows, toilets &amp; unicorns is a fun, albeit challenging, shoot \u2019em up experience. If you enjoy toilet humour, destroying pop-culture icons, and the cuteness of unicorns, then this is the game for you!\u201d<br>80 \u2013 Switch player<br><br>\u201cWe are now in a reality where this game is the most accurate representation of the world today, and I loved every second of blasting everything that showed up.\u201d<br>90 \u2013 Bonus stage<br><br>\u201cRainbows, Toilets &amp; Unicorns is a wonderful looking shmup that is sure to attract not only fans of the genre, but also any person that enjoys positive colour schemes. It has a modern sense of humour that is relevant and funny. Controls and progression have some snags but I bet the developer will fix them along with their own planned improvements.\u201d<br>70 \u2013 Two beard gaming<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1271030/ss_da92014d53887644ea57e09247776be291cf1eea.1920x1080.jpg?t=1737107471","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1271030/ss_da92014d53887644ea57e09247776be291cf1eea.600x338.jpg?t=1737107471"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1271030/ss_45f56f1545eb1822488a32837362c815c875bc75.1920x1080.jpg?t=1737107471","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1271030/ss_45f56f1545eb1822488a32837362c815c875bc75.600x338.jpg?t=1737107471"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i